import tests/cadkernel/brep_make/emit.dl
import lib/cadkernel/acis_history_box.dl

set kind to (maker argument 1) as an integer
set size to a cad vector3 with x (maker argument 2), y (maker argument 3) and z (maker argument 4)
set matrix to an empty list of a 64 bit floating-point number
loop index from 0 to 16:
    append (maker argument (index + 5)) to matrix
set rebuilt to the cad history rebuilt body for operation kind with box size size and transform matrix
emit maker number (rebuilt's failure)
if rebuilt's valid:
    emit maker body (rebuilt's value)
free matrix
